{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124049","id":4698014274,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGAYCQg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124049","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124049.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124049.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124049","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124049/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124049/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124049/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/139c6dac24297e86dc786ae70e19e4714395d1ba","number":124049,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add a reimport stack to prevent losing a reimport in nested reimport","user":{"login":"TheMagnat","id":45939503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTM5NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45939503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat","html_url":"https://github.com/TheMagnat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheMagnat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123950\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nCreated a `ReimportState` structure that store the old `scenes_modification_table`, `scenes_reimported` and `resources_reimported`.\r\nThis structure is used to fill a reimport stack `reimport_state_stack` that get pushed in `_resources_reimporting` and poped in `_resources_reimported`.\r\n\r\n## Points to confirm\r\n\r\n- I'm doing unsafe access on `reimport_state_stack`. Calling `_resources_reimported` whithout calling `_resources_reimporting` first would result in a crash. I don't think it should ever be the case but if I missed something, we should add some guard.\r\n- I'm getting the values by dereferencing `reimport_state_stack.back()` on every calls, maybe I should use a temporary reference instead in relevant places ?\r\n- I changed List to `LocalVector` and `HashMap` to `AHashMap` in `ReimportState`. If there is any contraindication I could revert this.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/user